# Local account settings are supplied by npm run dev:api.
# Do not add LOCAL_TEST_SIGN_IN to the deployed Worker configuration.
# For a manually started local Worker, copy these settings to .dev.vars:
# LOCAL_TEST_SIGN_IN=true
# APP_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:5197
# .dev.vars is ignored by Git. Keep provider secrets out of VITE_ variables.
# npm run dev:api creates a local CONFIG_ENCRYPTION_KEY if none is present.
# Keep that value stable; it protects API keys saved in local configuration.
